flowchart TD
    A[📱 Sales Rep Logs In] --> B[🏠 Dashboard<br>Sees Only: Sales KPI, Customers, Products]
    
    B --> C[➕ Click 'Create Invoice']
    
    C --> D[👤 Search / Select Customer]
    D --> E{Is Customer New?}
    E -->|Yes| F[✍️ Add Customer<br>Name + Phone Only]
    E -->|No| G[✅ Select Existing]
    
    F --> H[📦 Add Products to Invoice]
    G --> H
    
    H --> I[🔢 Enter Quantity]
    I --> J[💰 System Calculates Total<br>Cost Price is HIDDEN]
    J --> K[📨 Share via WhatsApp/Email]
    
    K --> L[✅ Invoice Marked as 'Sent']
    L --> M[🔚 End: Sales Rep logs out]
    
    note right of I
        ❌ Cannot see Profit Margin (Cost Price)
        ❌ Cannot Delete Customers
        ❌ Cannot see Reports
    end note
    
    style J fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f57f17
    style K fill:#81c784,stroke:#1b5e20